      "writtenOn": "2023-06-09T16:02:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a really good idea, thanks for the pointers.\n\nUnfortunately doing file I/O with `fs` is a bit of a pain right now. There\u0027s a dearth of helpful functions here (for example, there\u0027s not even a ReadFile)\n\nI\u0027m afraid this is really going to bloat the scope of this CL. Mind if I file a bug to improve this type of testing and defer this?",
