      "writtenOn": "2023-06-09T16:32:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d rather we follow-up rather than defer having unit tests to a cleanup bug.\n\n`ReadFile` is a fairly simple wrapper that may not need to be part of `fs`. A handful of extra lines should be sufficient for the lack of `ReadFile`:\n\n```\nf, err :\u003d fs.Open(\u003c\u003e)\nif err !\u003d nil {\n   //handle error\n}\ndefer f.Close()\ncontents, err :\u003d ioutil.ReadAll(f)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "495571c9_67a48464",
      "range": {
